# REQUIRES: python-api
# Persistent simulations on the CPU (D196), scenario nvt of
# Inputs/python_segments.py.
# NVT runs (velocity Verlet in double and mixed precision, leapfrog in
# double) of 1 + 7 + 13 steps against uninterrupted ones, and the phase of
# the coupling across their boundaries.
